	Fast info..

	If you already are running the Account ED Package, just copy
	this new version over your old QView.rexx..

	Else.. unpack the VTL-ACC2.lha archive and follow the steps
	in the Amiga.Guide manual, and then copy the new QView.rexx
	file over the old!

	This new version accepts fast commands like QV Nitzer,
	which will show info on Nitzer and let's you skip the
	questioning if you wan't to change your status!

