	Final words

	News! Right now I'm really busy making utils for you so hold on
	      for these goodies, programmed in C! Available SOON :)

		MasterStripper V1.01	<- The BEST LHA-Stripper EVER!
					   Strips over 800 adds (99% of them)
		Sysop Comment V2.01	<- The ultimate comment door! :)
		DirWorx V1.00		<- Checks if your files really are
					   online, if not deletes them !
		DataCollector V1.00	<- Grabs all data about your users
					   it can get and stores it in a file
		ConfMembers V1.00	<- Shows all users who has got access
					   to a conf, optionaly asks for a
					   conference password!
		ChatTimeFix V1.00	<- Fixes the problem with the users
					   chat time!
		Caller Status V1.00	<- Displays extended userinformation
					   with the DataCollectors Data File
		LastCallers V2.00	<- Now in C and uses the DataCollectors
					   data file! Available with 10 different
					   designs and look! (Completly)
		Quest V3.00		<- Now in C and icon configed
		Access Watch V3.00	<- Now in C and with more features
		Node Activities V3.00	<- The ultimate FrontEND door (& Who)
		Account Editor V3.00	<- Soon comming, coding right now! :)
					   replacement for the ARexx version!

		^^^ These doors are almost finished ^^^

	To come:

		PassWordFail V3.00	<- C replacement of Arexx V2.00
		QuestView V3.00		<- C replacement of Arexx V2.00
		WeekTop Devotion V2.00	<- Update in C of the LAC Version
		MonthTop Devotion V1.00	<- New door for the DataCollector
		TopBoard V1.00		<- Show various info & records
		Vote V2.00		<- Update of the very old DivVote!

